e/3/edit\">Edit</a>\n  </li>\n<li class=\"tabs__tab\">\n  <a href=\"/node/3/delete\" class=\"tabs__link js-tabs-link\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/3/delete\">Delete</a>\n  </li>\n<li class=\"tabs__tab\">\n  <a href=\"/node/3/revisions\" class=\"tabs__link js-tabs-link\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/3/revisions\">Revisions</a>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n  </nav>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n            \n\n  <div class=\"region region--breadcrumb grid-full layout--pass--content-medium ie11-autorow\">\n    \n\n<div id=\"block-olivero-breadcrumbs\" class=\"contextual-region block block-system block-system-breadcrumb-block\">\n  \n    <div data-contextual-id=\"block:block=olivero_breadcrumbs:langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"9F6FNn7dE-roL5jUoJaZPJ6Ubh8Dic4pjhA5YndN9MU\"></div>\n      <div class=\"block__content\">\n        <nav class=\"breadcrumb\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"system-breadcrumb\">\n    <h2 id=\"system-breadcrumb\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Breadcrumb</h2>\n    <div class=\"breadcrumb__content\">\n      <ol class=\"breadcrumb__list\">\n                  <li class=\"breadcrumb__item\">\n                          <a href=\"/\" class=\"breadcrumb__link\">Home</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ol>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n\n                          <main role=\"main\">\n                \n\n  <div class=\"region region--content-above grid-full layout--pass--content-medium ie11-autorow\">\n    \n\n\n<div id=\"block-olivero-page-title\" class=\"contextual-region block block-core block-page-title-block\">\n  \n  \n<div class=\"shortcut-wrapper\">\n  <h1 class=\"title page-title\">\n<span>Building a module with Composer and Symfony</span>\n</h1>\n<a href=\"/admin/config/user-interface/shortcut/manage/default/add-link-inline?link=node/3&amp;name=Building%20a%20module%20with%20Composer%20and%20Symfony&amp;destination=/node/3&amp;token=LgqhtQUgbzmWo84ySr3W9TlYcEB5poyyJVuy7DStBXA\" class=\"shortcut-action shortcut-action--add\"><span class=\"shortcut-action__icon\"></span><span class=\"shortcut-action__message\">Add to <em class=\"placeholder\">Default</em> shortcuts</span></a></div>\n\n  <div data-contextual-id=\"block:block=olivero_page_title:langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"3fOTeB5WmQbSXkuKCuS4_N0dDwap_09xrTVTpKK02Xc\"></div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n                \n\n  <div class=\"region region--content grid-full layout--pass--content-medium ie11-autorow\" id=\"content\">\n    \n\n<div id=\"block-olivero-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"block__content\">\n      \n\n<article data-history-node-id=\"3\" role=\"article\" class=\"contextual-region node node--type-article grid-full ie11-autorow node--promoted node--view-mode-full\">\n  <header class=\"layout--content-narrow\">\n    \n          <div data-contextual-id=\"node:node=3:changed=1779785912&amp;langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"PMnUD8e6_6hBwyyy9btKrol9gKmETTIIIEXNsjyV0Nw\"></div>\n          <div class=\"node__meta\">\n              <span>\n          By <span><a title=\"View user profile.\" href=\"/user/1\">admin</a></span>, 26  May,  2026\n        </span>\n        \n      </div>\n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content layout--content-narrow\">\n        \n            <div class=\"text-content clearfix field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>A modern <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Drupal\" data-description=\"A free and open-source content management system written in PHP and used to power millions of…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/1\">Drupal</span> <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Module\" data-description=\"A package of code that adds functionality to a Drupal site. Modules can be part of core,…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/6\">module</span> begins as a <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Composer\" data-description=\"The standard package manager for PHP. Drupal projects use Composer to declare and install core,…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/16\">Composer</span> package. Composer resolves third-party libraries, including those provided by <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Symfony\" data-description=\"A PHP framework whose components such as HttpKernel, DependencyInjection and Routing form the…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/15\">Symfony</span>, and integrates them into the autoloader.</p>\n<p>Inside the module, a <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Service\" data-description=\"A reusable object managed by the dependency injection container. Services keep procedural code thin…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/13\">service</span> is declared in YAML and wired together by <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Dependency injection\" data-description=\"A design pattern in which an object receives the services it needs from the outside, rather than…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/14\">dependency injection</span>. The service can then be reused by a controller, a <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Plugin\" data-description=\"A reusable piece of swappable functionality with a discovered interface. Examples include blocks,…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/12\">plugin</span>, a <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Filter\" data-description=\"A pluggable text-processing step applied to formatted text before display. Filters can sanitize…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/18\">filter</span> or a queue worker, without any of them having to know how it was built.</p>\n<p>Because the <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Configuration\" data-description=\"Settings that describe how a site behaves, such as content types, field definitions and view modes…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/19\">configuration</span> of services lives outside the code, the same module can be plugged into different projects with minimal changes.</p></div>\n      \n  </div>\n      <div id=\"comments\" class=\"layout--content-narrow\">\n      \n\n<section data-drupal-selector=\"comments\" class=\"comments\">\n\n      \n    <h2 class=\"comments__title\">Comments</h2>\n    \n  \n      <div class=\"add-comment\">\n            <div class=\"add-comment__form\">\n        <drupal-render-placeholder callback=\"comment.lazy_builders:renderForm\" arguments=\"0=node&amp;1=3&amp;2=comment&amp;3=comment\" token=\"Y85zpvOo0idsDualBn4IsyXXwzfA_2wor3FCVaO8Mgo\"></drupal-render-placeholder>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n\n</section>\n\n    </div>\n  </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n              </main>\n                        \n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"social-bar\">\n          \n<div class=\"social-bar__inner fixable\">\n  <div class=\"rotate\">\n    \n\n<div id=\"block-olivero-syndicate\" class=\"contextual-region block block-node block-node-syndicate-block\" role=\"complementary\">\n  \n    <div data-contextual-id=\"block:block=olivero_syndicate:langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"o6QzMCPUXhhRrtaeGis5qmNWPzr5zKIPou6moyUh1NA\"></div>\n      <div class=\"block__content\">\n      \n\n\n\n<a href=\"/rss.xml\" class=\"feed-icon\">\n  <span class=\"feed-icon__label\">\n    RSS feed\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"feed-icon__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.2\" height=\"14.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 14.2 14.2\">\n  <path d=\"M4,12.2c0-2.5-3.9-2.4-3.9,0C0.1,14.7,4,14.6,4,12.2z M9.1,13.4C8.7,9,5.2,5.5,0.8,5.1c-1,0-1,2.7-0.1,2.7c3.1,0.3,5.5,2.7,5.8,5.8c0,0.7,2.1,0.7,2.5,0.3C9.1,13.7,9.1,13.6,9.1,13.4z M14.2,13.5c-0.1-3.5-1.6-6.9-4.