t-action--add\"><span class=\"shortcut-action__icon\"></span><span class=\"shortcut-action__message\">Add to <em class=\"placeholder\">Default</em> shortcuts</span></a></div>\n\n  <div data-contextual-id=\"block:block=olivero_page_title:langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"3fOTeB5WmQbSXkuKCuS4_N0dDwap_09xrTVTpKK02Xc\"></div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n                \n\n  <div class=\"region region--content grid-full layout--pass--content-medium ie11-autorow\" id=\"content\">\n    \n\n<div id=\"block-olivero-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"block__content\">\n      \n\n<article data-history-node-id=\"5\" role=\"article\" class=\"contextual-region node node--type-article grid-full ie11-autorow node--promoted node--view-mode-full\">\n  <header class=\"layout--content-narrow\">\n    \n          <div data-contextual-id=\"node:node=5:changed=1779785912&amp;langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"AyyQVCyJ4yEm2gqh8Pq1WqmgrRy5E-ADQXObdpnWGr0\"></div>\n          <div class=\"node__meta\">\n              <span>\n          By <span><a title=\"View user profile.\" href=\"/user/1\">admin</a></span>, 26  May,  2026\n        </span>\n        \n      </div>\n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content layout--content-narrow\">\n        \n            <div class=\"text-content clearfix field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>A <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Filter\" data-description=\"A pluggable text-processing step applied to formatted text before display. Filters can sanitize…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/18\">filter</span> transforms text after it has been authored but before it is rendered. <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Drupal\" data-description=\"A free and open-source content management system written in PHP and used to power millions of…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/1\">Drupal</span> ships with filters that sanitise HTML, convert URLs into links, and align embedded images. Custom filters can highlight glossary words, blur sensitive data, or rewrite shortcodes.</p>\n<p>Because the filter result is cached per format, even an expensive transformation runs only when content actually changes. This makes filters a natural place to add editorial helpers without slowing down delivery.</p></div>\n      \n  </div>\n      <div id=\"comments\" class=\"layout--content-narrow\">\n      \n\n<section data-drupal-selector=\"comments\" class=\"comments\">\n\n      \n    <h2 class=\"comments__title\">Comments</h2>\n    \n  \n      <div class=\"add-comment\">\n            <div class=\"add-comment__form\">\n        <drupal-render-placeholder callback=\"comment.lazy_builders:renderForm\" arguments=\"0=node&amp;1=5&amp;2=comment&amp;3=comment\" token=\"FDpRQwYdbnmWRnYAH9qRd8tLV8cpeL87AjLAWjYuDfg\"></drupal-render-placeholder>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  \n  \n\n</section>\n\n    </div>\n  </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n              </main>\n                        \n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"social-bar\">\n          \n<div class=\"social-bar__inner fixable\">\n  <div class=\"rotate\">\n    \n\n<div id=\"block-olivero-syndicate\" class=\"contextual-region block block-node block-node-syndicate-block\" role=\"complementary\">\n  \n    <div data-contextual-id=\"block:block=olivero_syndicate:langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"o6QzMCPUXhhRrtaeGis5qmNWPzr5zKIPou6moyUh1NA\"></div>\n      <div class=\"block__content\">\n      \n\n\n\n<a href=\"/rss.xml\" class=\"feed-icon\">\n  <span class=\"feed-icon__label\">\n    RSS feed\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"feed-icon__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.2\" height=\"14.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 14.2 14.2\">\n  <path d=\"M4,12.2c0-2.5-3.9-2.4-3.9,0C0.1,14.7,4,14.6,4,12.2z M9.1,13.4C8.7,9,5.2,5.5,0.8,5.1c-1,0-1,2.7