lImnJCy9HBtMkGOY\"></div>\n          <div class=\"node__meta\">\n        <span>\n          By <span class=\"node__author\"><span><a title=\"View user profile.\" href=\"/user/1\">admin</a></span></span>, 26  May,  2026\n        </span>\n        \n      </div>\n              <div class=\"node__top-wrapper\">\n        \n        <h2 class=\"node__title\">\n          <a href=\"/node/4\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>Migrating legacy content into Drupal</span>\n</a>\n        </h2>\n      </div>\n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content\">\n    \n            <div class=\"text-content clearfix field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>A <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Migration\" data-description=\"A defined process that imports data from a source — a legacy database, CSV, or earlier Drupal…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/20\">migration</span> moves data from a legacy source into the <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Drupal\" data-description=\"A free and open-source content management system written in PHP and used to power millions of…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/1\">Drupal</span> <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" a=\"\"></span></p></div>\n      \n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n\n<article data-history-node-id=\"3\" role=\"article\" class=\"contextual-region node node--type-article node--promoted node--view-mode-teaser\">\n  <header>\n    \n    <div data-contextual-id=\"node:node=3:changed=1779785912&amp;langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"PMnUD8e6_6hBwyyy9btKrol9gKmETTIIIEXNsjyV0Nw\"></div>\n          <div class=\"node__meta\">\n        <span>\n          By <span class=\"node__author\"><span><a title=\"View user profile.\" href=\"/user/1\">admin</a></span></span>, 26  May,  2026\n        </span>\n        \n      </div>\n              <div class=\"node__top-wrapper\">\n        \n        <h2 class=\"node__title\">\n          <a href=\"/node/3\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>Building a module with Composer and Symfony</span>\n</a>\n        </h2>\n      </div>\n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content\">\n    \n            <div class=\"text-content clearfix field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>A modern <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Drupal\" data-description=\"A free and open-source content management system written in PHP and used to power millions of…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/1\">Drupal</span> <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Module\" data-description=\"A package of code that adds functionality to a Drupal site.&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;\"></span></p></div>\n      \n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n\n<article data-history-node-id=\"2\" role=\"article\" class=\"contextual-region node node--type-article node--promoted node--view-mode-teaser\">\n  <header>\n    \n    <div data-contextual-id=\"node:node=2:changed=1779785912&amp;langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"X13bs-Zk6bz8eF4UkYjKRG4YG7q0ap3y-NUd1ugJoJk\"></div>\n          <div class=\"node__meta\">\n        <span>\n          By <span class=\"node__author\"><span><a title=\"View user profile.\" href=\"/user/1\">admin</a></span></span>, 26  May,  2026\n        </span>\n        \n      </div>\n              <div class=\"node__top-wrapper\">\n        \n        <h2 class=\"node__title\">\n          <a href=\"/node/2\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>How caching keeps a Drupal site fast</span>\n</a>\n        </h2>\n      </div>\n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content\">\n    \n            <div class=\"text-content clearfix field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Performance in <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Drupal\" data-description=\"A free and open-source content management system written in PHP and used to power millions of…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/1\">Drupal</span> relies on layered caching. Every <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Render array\" data-description=\"A structured PHP array describing what should appear on the page.&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;\"></span></p></div>\n      \n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\">\n\n<article data-history-node-id=\"1\" role=\"article\" class=\"contextual-region node node--type-article node--promoted node--view-mode-teaser\">\n  <header>\n    \n    <div data-contextual-id=\"node:node=1:changed=1779785912&amp;langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"31wGpy_6XWj1hZ-qXGthLK1d2H2Hh80QTPpm2AqYcMs\"></div>\n          <div class=\"node__meta\">\n        <span>\n          By <span class=\"node__author\"><span><a title=\"View user profile.\" href=\"/user/1\">admin</a></span></span>, 26  May,  2026\n        </span>\n        \n      </div>\n              <div class=\"node__top-wrapper\">\n        \n        <h2 class=\"node__title\">\n          <a href=\"/node/1\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n<span>A short tour of Drupal core concepts</span>\n</a>\n        </h2>\n      </div>\n      </header>\n  <div class=\"node__content\">\n    \n            <div class=\"text-content clearfix field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Drupal\" data-description=\"A free and open-source content management system written in PHP and used to power millions of…\" data-read-more-url=\"/taxonomy/term/1\">Drupal</span> is a powerful content management system that organises information into entities. A <span class=\"glossary-tooltip\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Node\" data-description=\"In Drupal, a node is a single piece of content such as an article, blog post, or page.&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;\"></span></p></div>\n      \n  </div>\n</article>\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n  \n      \n        \n</div>\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n              </main>\n                        \n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"social-bar\">\n          \n<div class=\"social-bar__inner fixable\">\n  <div class=\"rotate\">\n    \n\n<div id=\"block-olivero-syndicate\" class=\"contextual-region block block-node block-node-syndicate-block\" role=\"complementary\">\n  \n    <div data-contextual-id=\"block:block=olivero_syndicate:langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"o6QzMCPUXhhRrtaeGis5qmNWPzr5zKIPou6moyUh1NA\"></div>\n      <div class=\"block__content\">\n      \n\n\n\n<a href=\"/rss.xml\" class=\"feed-icon\">\n  <span class=\"feed-icon__label\">\n    RSS feed\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"feed-icon__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.2\" height=\"14.2\" viewBox=\"0 0 14.2 14.2\">\n  <path d=\"M4,12.2c0-2.5-3.9-2.4-3.9,0C0.1,14.7,4,14.6,4,12.2z M9.1,13.4C8.7,9,5.2,5.5,0.8,5.1c-1,0-1,2.7-0.1,2.7c3.1,0.3,5.5,2.7,5.8,5.8c0,0.7,2.1,0.7,2.5,0.3C9.1,13.7,9.1,13.6,9.1,13.4z M14.2,13.5c-0.1-3.5-1.6-6.9-4.1-9.3C7.6,1.7,4.3,0.2,0.8,0c-1,0-1,2.6-0.1,2.6c5.8,0.3,10.5,5,10.8,10.8C11.5,14.5,14.3,14.4,14.2,13.5z\"/>\n</svg>\n  </span>\n</a>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n      <div class=\"site-footer__inner container\">\n        \n        \n\n  <div class=\"region region--footer-bottom grid-full layout--pass--content-medium ie11-autorow\">\n    \n\n<div id=\"block-olivero-powered\" class=\"contextual-region block block-system block-system-powered-by-block\">\n  \n    <div data-contextual-id=\"block:block=olivero_powered:langcode=en\" data-contextual-token=\"5uHuliA4V_NyNOJFunzhZBfhYvaeQdQHOYSM_VIKBJc\"></div>\n    \n  <span>\n    Powered by    <a href=\"https://www.drupal.o